# 必填：细粒度 Token，仅选择 Profile 仓库并授予 Contents 读写权限。
# Required: fine-grained PAT, selected Profile repository, Contents read/write only.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# 必填：已存在的 GitHub Profile 仓库，格式为 owner/repo。
# Required: your existing GitHub Profile repository, in owner/repo format.
GITHUB_REPOSITORY=your-name/your-name

# 可选：公开上游仓库，格式为 owner/repo，始终跟踪 main 最新提交。
# Optional: public upstream in owner/repo format, always following the latest main commit.
# 留空默认 Lancasteerr/my-codex-activity（来自包信息）；修改后运行 setup，替换并提交 Profile 工作流。
# Empty defaults to Lancasteerr/my-codex-activity (from package metadata); after changing, run setup, then replace and commit the Profile workflow.
TOOL_REPOSITORY=

# 可选：codex.exe 的绝对路径；留空自动发现。
# Optional: absolute path to codex.exe. Leave empty for automatic discovery.
CODEX_BIN=

# 可选：IANA 显示时区；留空使用本机时区。
# Optional: IANA display timezone. Leave empty to use this computer's timezone.
TIMEZONE=

# 可选：图片主题，github-dark（默认）或 github-light；修改后运行 sync 生效。
# Optional: chart theme, github-dark (default) or github-light. Run sync to apply changes.
ACTIVITY_THEME=github-dark

# 可选：图片语言，en（默认）或 zh-CN；修改后运行 sync 生效。
# Optional: chart language, en (default) or zh-CN. Run sync to apply changes.
ACTIVITY_LANGUAGE=en
